1047
01:12:28.523 --> 01:12:29.357
Ronny, ne!

1048
01:12:30.440 --> 01:12:31.357
Ronny!

1049
01:12:38.648 --> 01:12:39.773
Jeetu!

1050
01:13:01.482 --> 01:13:03.815
